uing into the full IA and failure model.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_002a496e23ec3bf4016a7e18ce141881919501794ba23f71b4\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rj6So040piqeAJbyHckOMpdQ|fc_002a496e23ec3bf4016a7e18d5f164819189bb4507e7ea7243","name":"task_send","arguments":{"to":"lead","summary":"Initial standards-backed presentation UX constraints","message":"Immediate UX leads (authoritative sources verified): (1) presenter/second-device UI must reflow at 320 CSS px without loss or 2D scrolling per WCAG 2.2 SC 1.4.10: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/reflow.html. (2) interactive targets must be >=24x24 CSS px or sufficiently spaced per SC 2.5.8; for live-operation controls I recommend a stronger 44-48px product target: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/target-size-minimum.html. (3) keyboard focus needs a 2 CSS px-equivalent perimeter and >=3:1 contrast per SC 2.4.13: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/focus-appearance.html. (4) sync/connection/audience-count changes should be programmatic status messages without moving focus per SC 4.1.3: https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG22/Understanding/status-messages.html. Full IA/recovery synthesis follows."}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_rIx92lX3XKqomOyhruD67Mlg|fc_002a496e23ec3bf4016a7e18d5f1748191837f900d7193d4e0","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"C:\\Users\\steve\\Desktop\\projects\\impromptu-r2\\docs\\신청서.pdf"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_EsKTIgTddHAia13avdfXaZTX|fc_002a496e23ec3bf4016a7e18d5f18081919f2009e09c0e0d2d","name":"webfetch","arguments":{"url":"https://support.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/keyboard-shortcuts-in-windows-dcc61a57-8ff0-cffe-9796-cb9706c75eec","format":"markdown","timeout":60}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_TrwJ0S9kLByWlcZQCbbICvKx|fc_002a496e23ec3bf4016a7e18d5f18881918936bd11b05b5598","name":"webfetch","arguments":{"url":"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/apps/design/devices/screen-sizes-and-breakpoints-for-responsive-design","format":