ive-console structure","message":"IA recommendation: top-level modes are Prepare / Live / Review, not a flat feature nav. Prepare = session brief, content/evidence, team/roles, display/device setup, rehearsal/readiness. Live = Public Stage + Presenter Console + Team Signals as role-specific views of one session state. Review = timeline, evidence ledger, decisions, incidents, exports/share. Presenter desktop: persistent health/status bar; three regions Now (dominant), Next (preview), Signals (evidence requests, messages, faults); sticky transport controls remain spatially stable. Phone/second device: single-column Now with bottom tabs Now / Next / Signals and a thumb-reachable control dock; never squeeze desktop columns. Public stage: zero app nav/private chrome, only approved content, optional captions/session code, and explicit holding/reconnecting/end states. Evidence has two projections: public card = claim/source/date/status; operator card = plus excerpt, provenance URL, reviewer, confidence, publish/hold actions. Team messaging should be structured operational signals (Urgent cue, Evidence request, Review, Ops), with acknowledge/resolve/pin; general chat is secondary and must never overlay the public stage."}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","usage":{"input":1459,"output":1220,"cacheRead":91648,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":856,"totalTokens":94327,"cost":{"input":0.007295,"output":0.0366,"cacheRead":0.045824,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.089719}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786648870058,"responseId":"resp_002a496e23ec3bf4016a7e192671108191b1d61c651d55e04c","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
